This article attempts to break down the visual effects contained within the [[psychedelic#Subjective effects|psychedelic experience]] into simple, easy to understand titles, descriptions and levelling systems. This is done without depending on metaphors, analogies or personal trip reports. The article starts off with descriptions of the simpler effects and works its way up towards more complex experiences as it progresses.
